[
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "# [17] Container Docker Kubernetes",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "📋 Panoramica",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "Materia su containerizzazione e orchestrazione. Copre Docker (immagini, container, Compose) e Kubernetes (pod, deployment, service, scaling). Repository come submodule Git separato.",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Tecnologie**: Docker, Docker Compose, Kubernetes (kubectl, YAML), Draw.io (diagrams)",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "block_property": "divider"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "📚 Indice degli argomenti",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "1. Docker — Fondamenti",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Cos'è un container**: processo isolato, stesso kernel dell'host, leggero vs VM",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Immagine vs Container**: immagine = template, container = istanza in esecuzione",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Dockerfile**: ricetta per costruire un'immagine",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "2. Docker — Comandi Principali",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "docker build -t mia-app:latest .    # costruisci immagine",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "docker run -d -p 8080:80 mia-app    # avvia container",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "docker ps                           # container attivi",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "docker images                       # immagini locali",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "docker exec -it <id> /bin/sh        # shell nel container",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "docker logs <id>                    # log container",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "docker stop <id>                    # ferma container",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "docker compose up -d                # multi-container",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "3. Docker Compose",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "version: '3'",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "services:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "  web:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "    build: ./app",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "    ports:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "      - \"8080:80\"",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "  db:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "    image: postgres:15",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "    environment:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: secret",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "    volumes:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "      - pgdata:/var/lib/postgresql/data",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "volumes:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "  pgdata:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "4. Kubernetes — Architettura",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Cluster**: Master node (control plane) + Worker nodes",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Componenti master**: API Server, Scheduler, Controller Manager, etcd",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Componenti worker**: Kubelet, kube-proxy, container runtime",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "5. Kubernetes — Oggetti Principali",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Pod**: unità minima, 1+ container",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Deployment**: gestione repliche, rolling update, rollback",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Service**: astrazione di rete, bilanciamento carico (ClusterIP, NodePort, LoadBalancer)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**ConfigMap / Secret**: configurazione e dati sensibili",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Ingress**: routing HTTP/HTTPS esterno",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**PersistentVolume (PV/PVC)**: storage persistente",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "apiVersion: apps/v1",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "kind: Deployment",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "metadata:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "  name: nginx-deployment",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "spec:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "  replicas: 3",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "  selector:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "    matchLabels:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "      app: nginx",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "  template:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "    metadata:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "      labels:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "        app: nginx",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "    spec:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "      containers:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "      - name: nginx",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "        image: nginx:latest",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "        ports:",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "        - containerPort: 80",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "6. Kubernetes — Comandi",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "kubectl get pods                    # lista pod",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "kubectl get nodes                   # nodi cluster",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml    # deploy",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "kubectl delete pod <nome>           # elimina pod",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "kubectl logs <pod>                  # log",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "kubectl scale deployment/nginx --replicas=5",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "kubectl expose deployment/nginx --port=80 --type=LoadBalancer",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "block_property": "divider"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "⚡ Punti Chiave",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Container ≠ VM**: condividono il kernel host, avvio in secondi, leggeri",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Immutabilità**: le immagini non si modificano, si ricostruiscono",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**K8s desidera stato dichiarativo**: scrivi YAML, K8s lo realizza",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Health check**: liveness + readiness probe per resilienza",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Mai hardcodare credenziali**: sempre Secret + ConfigMap",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Submodule**: `17_Container_Docker_Kubernetes/` è su repo separato — `git submodule update --init --recursive`",
      "block_property": "numbered_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
